  Lastly, $\mathsf{Remove\ } \phi^U$ is $GL$ invariant,
  since for $A_0 = \operatorname{diag}(1, A) \in GL_0(\mathbb{R}^d)$, with $A \in GL(\mathbb{R}^d)$,
