  [0, 1, 2, 3, 4] \\
  [0, 1, 2, 4, 5] \\
  [0, 1, 2, 5, 6] \\
  [0, 2, 3, 4, 5] \\
  [0, 2, 3, 5, 6] \\
  [0, 3, 4, 5, 6]
  \end{align*}


  For $d=5$, $n=8$ we get the subsequences
